        "original_id": "52bbac9c-074b-5241-affa-be53ad972b63",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thilo Rothkirch, Matthias Lechner, Andrea Romano\n- Films: Laura's Star, Wonder Woman (2009 film), I'm a Fish, Escape from Planet Earth\n- Roles: producer, director, casting director, voice director, voice actress\n- Companies/Franchises: Warner Bros., DC Comics\n\nFacts:\n- Andrea Romano was born on December 3, 1955.\n- Laura's Star is a 2004 German animated feature film.\n- Laura's Star was produced and directed by Thilo Rothkirch.\n- Wonder Woman is a 2009 direct-to-DVD animated superhero film about the superheroine Wonder Woman.\n- Matthias Lechner worked on I'm a Fish, Escape from Planet Earth, and Laura's Star, among other films.\n- Andrea Romano is an American casting director, voice director, and voice actress.\n- Andrea Romano's work includes Tiny Toon Adventures, Animaniacs, Freakazoid, Pinky and the Brain, Teen Titans, The Legend of Korra, Static Shock, Justice League, Justice League Unlimited, Batman Beyond, and Phineas and Ferb.\n- Andrea Romano also worked on multiple Warner Bros. Animation and DC Comics direct-to-video films, including Wonder Woman.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
